<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins steady to $1.00 lower; butts steady to 2.00 lower; skinned hams 17-20 lbs. steady; 20-26 lbs. 1.00 lower; seedless bellies mostly 2.00-4.00 lower; lean trimmings 1.00-2.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with light demand and mostly moderate offerings. - USDA</p>
